# Patterns: cue on the bar, copy, save, reboot, everything comes back. (Tonic keys: SHIFT = black key 11; SHIFT + SEQ copies,
# SHIFT + REC + a white key pastes there, SHIFT + a white key changes the pattern. The old SAVE copy and the HOME page's
# white-key pick and chain range are gone; the chain is the CHAIN screen: tonic_chain_screen.)
wait 300
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w8
# copy pattern 1 to pattern 2 (SHIFT + SEQ, then SHIFT + PLAY + white key 2), then make 2 different
key b10 down
tapkey b8
key b9 down
tapkey w1
key b9 up
key b10 up
expect rec 0
key b10 down
tapkey w1
key b10 up
expect pattern 2
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.8 1
tap EDIT
tapkey b1
tapkey w4
expect hit0.1.4 1
# play pattern 2, cue 1: it changes on the bar, not before
press HOME
turn SELECT -5
release HOME
expect tempo 120
tap PLAY
wait 1000
key b10 down
tapkey w0
key b10 up
expect cue 1
expect pattern 2
wait 1100
expect pattern 1
tap PLAY
# save, scramble, reboot from the simulated flash
savenow
expect store_writes 6
reboot
wait 300
expect pattern 1
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.8 1
key b10 down
tapkey w1
key b10 up
expect hit0.1.4 1
